Q. Steps to create ASG in AWS?
AD: Homework For 07-Aug-2025:  dikshaingole5@gmail.com 
AP: Below are the steps to create ASG.
Create a Launch Template – Define how EC2 instances should be launched.
Make an Auto Scaling Group (ASG) – Start setting up the scaling group.
Pick VPC and Subnets – Choose where the instances will run.
Attach Load Balancer (if needed) – Link with ALB to distribute traffic.
Set Scaling Rules – Define when to add or remove EC2 instances.
Set Health Checks – Ensure instances are working fine.
Add Alerts (Optional) – Get notified when scaling happens.
